137|That's a lovely way to see things.|e=coeur
138|Our work doesn't need|
139|to represent all our passions.|
140|Exactly. And I think that removes|
141|some of the pressure|
142|when you think about your future.|
143|But there's another factor|
144|that strongly influences our career choices.|
145|I think I know: family?|e=idee
146|Yes.|
147|The expectations of our parents and loved ones.|
148|Ah, the famous discussions|e=rire
149|during family meals!|
150|When I was a teenager,|
151|everyone had an idea for my future.|
152|Really? Tell me!|e=surpris
153|My uncle wanted|
154|me to work in finance.|i=argent:la finance
155|My aunt thought|
156|computing would be perfect for me.|
157|And my grandfather kept saying|
