170|And it's not always easy|
171|to tell the difference|
172|between what we really want|
173|and what others expect from us.|
174|Exactly. Parents often think|
175|about stability, salary|
176|and job opportunities.|
177|Those are important questions.|
178|But we also have to think about our personality|
179|and what we enjoy.|
180|Yes. Because we're the ones who'll do|
181|this job every day.|
182|And a prestigious job|
183|won't necessarily make us happy.|
